13t0|n|A light, brisk musical movement. ; A light, humorous piece of writing, esp. in rhyme; a farce in verse; a ballad. ; A piece of sport; a trick; a prank. ; A trolling bait, consisting of a bright spoon and a hook attached. ; A small machine or handy tool ; A contrivance fastened to or inclosing a piece of work, and having hard steel surfaces to guide a tool, as a drill, or to form a shield or templet to work to, as in filing. ; An apparatus or a machine for jigging ore. ; To cut or form, as a piece of metal, in a jigging machine.	a:9v5,63,3;1fju,46,4;1uus,43,3;1ru6,20,3~1fju,46,4;1uus,43,3;9v5,63,3;1ru6,20,3	v:9v5,47,1~9v5,47,1	n:21hb,48,4;t6p,38,1~21hb,48,4;t6p,38,1
